  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="9e1a192e-92b5-4cc3-8e4d-694ab599ef05"><problem><para>
      <para>Here are the first two terms of some different arithmetic sequences. What is the 5th term of each sequence?</para>
        <para>–2, 4 ...
          </para>
        </para></problem><solution><para>22</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is 22. The pattern continues 10, 16, 22. </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
